    task: "Your school magazine is running a series on student wellbeing. Write an article (200–250 words) for your fellow students on this question: Could a walk among trees do more for our minds than hours of constant screen use? Give your article an intriguing title, speak directly to your readers and end with a memorable conclusion.",
